    "appraisalHints": "Not a definition of the emotion. Tentative hints that may help when exploring the difference between similar words.",
    "contextTags": "Loose clues about situations in which someone might use this word. The summary can quote a tag when it meets what the user said mattered, so tags are plain everyday nouns.",
    "contextDependent": "UI metadata saying that how pleasant or unpleasant this feels can depend on the situation, so it is not fixed as positive or negative. It is not an essential category of “mixed emotion.” When narrowing candidates it can be offered from either side.",
